@1. The prefixes that are taken
.
=1. THE PREFIXES THAT ARE TAKEN
.
.  GP.
.      OWNER: GPB.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: keywords, not variables -- see SEC 2, this one is
.        different
.
.  STR.
.      OWNER: STRINGS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: string helpers
.
.  STR.USING.
.      OWNER: STRUSING.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: a number to a template, kept apart from the rest of STR.
.
.  THEME.
.      OWNER: THEME.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: colour roles
.
.  APPSYS.
.      OWNER: APPSYS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: screen save/restore, panels to disk
.
.  LINEINPUT.
.      OWNER: LINEINPUT.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: entry fields
.
.  KB.
.      OWNER: KB.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the keyboard drain
.
.  MENU.
.      OWNER: MENU.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: menus: the row store, the popup and the bar.
.        MENUPULL.INC.BL's variables too
.
.  MENUTO.
.      OWNER: MENU.INC.BL MENUPULL.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the runners, called with GP.FN
.
.  MENUPULL.
.      OWNER: MENUPULL.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: a dropdown under a bar item: labels and one constant
.
.  GUI.
.      OWNER: GUI.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the box the dialogs sit in, and the form and controls
.        inside it
.
.  GUI.LISTBOX.
.      OWNER: GUI-DIALOGS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the listbox dialog's answer, kept apart from the rest of
.        GUI.
.
.  DLG.
.      OWNER: GUI-DIALOGS.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the dialog verbs: their arguments, and their internals
.
.  STASH.
.      OWNER: STASH.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: a text rectangle into a RAM bank, and back
.
.  STASH.FILE.
.      OWNER: STASHFILE.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the same rectangle through a file, kept apart from the
.        rest of STASH.
.
.  SORT.
.      OWNER: SORT.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: shell sort a string array in place
.
.  STRCASE.
.      OWNER: STRCASE.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: case, rewriting a string in place
.
.  BMX.
.      OWNER: BMX.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: BMX bitmap loading
.
.  BMXK.
.      OWNER: BMX.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: its KERNAL/VERA constants, kept apart from its variables
.
.  FILE.
.      OWNER: FILEIO.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the drive: status, exists, delete, rename, directories
.
.  FILE.DIR.
.      OWNER: FILEDIR.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: reading a directory, kept apart from the rest of FILE.
.
.  SV.
.      OWNER: STASHVRAM.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the VRAM store. SVGC. is STASHVRAMGC.INC.BL's one constant
.
.  KV.
.      OWNER: KV.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: keys and values in one RAM bank
.
.  MATH.
.      OWNER: MATH.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: the smaller and the larger of two numbers
.
.  MEM.
.      OWNER: MEM.INC.BL
.      WHAT IT IS: a block copied, a block filled, and the two KERNAL
.        constants
.
.Pick anything else for your own program. AIRLIFT., GAME., MAP. -- a prefix
.costs nothing at runtime because BASLOAD crunches every identifier down to a
.short BASIC variable, so a long readable name and a two-letter one compile
.to exactly the same thing.
.
.Do not reuse a taken prefix for a name the module has not defined.
.THEME.MINE looks free today; it is one library update away from not being.
.
